---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Services from '../../components/Services.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Software & logistics consulting"
  description="OuterForge Quality software, bespoke applications on the OuterForge platform, and hands-on SAP Business One and Produmex logistics consulting."
>
  <PageIntro
    label="Software and services"
    title="Develop the software. Improve the operation."
    description="An existing Quality application, bespoke development on OuterForge, and logistics consulting for SAP Business One and Produmex WMS. Work directly with Tom on the part your operation needs."
  />
  <section class="section service-area">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Services />
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section studio-section">
    <div class="wrap editorial-split">
      <h2>
        Start with a workflow.
        <br />
        Build a useful first step.
      </h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We look at the process with the people who do the work. What data do
          they need? Where does it live? What should happen when they finish?
        </p>
        <p>
          For quality control, we start by checking the fit of OuterForge
          Quality, then agree configuration and any extensions. Bespoke
          applications use the same OuterForge platform, with its existing
          connections and shared features.
        </p>
        <p>
          Consulting can stand on its own: investigating picking behaviour,
          reviewing a warehouse workflow or resolving a SAP/Produmex integration
          issue. Scope, delivery and ongoing support are agreed around the work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
